==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|SM Promo|Mewtwo|214}}, one of the {{TCG|SM Black Star Promos}}.
*'''Power Blast''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Movie VS Pack|Butler's Salamence|11}} from the {{TCG|Movie Commemoration VS Pack}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|X}}.

